<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-03T09:46:53.115Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:46:53 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;In Manipur Kuki volunteers were shot dead and five Kuki men were found mutilated, sparking protests in Kangpokpi and Noney with police using tear gas and batons. In Kashmir a terror financing probe linked to LeT led authorities to search four locations, while an Indian national was killed in an attack on a commercial vessel near Oman. A Tata Sumo crash in Ramban killed one person and injured two. A Supreme Court bail petition was filed by Yumlembam Jiban Singh, accused of parading Kuki women naked, citing trial delays. 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontline Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Greater Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxOckctX25xcWVKYk5YVFZRZFZrZW03di1XVXlDc1AzN1pSbHN4MS1HZzdLa3ZRRTZSQXdMVzl5Z3hfMVNhRUFQREpaUmFKQkNvcmM1OUQ5cWdPWXZhR3l6eGwzVkg1UXJiLTA0dmNnakhVU2xpcU1FRGlQTUtMdTY4TVk4MWgteFZJNThFekNtb3M0NzJFbGNrc3I2YkhzdmFYNldlVmRmZFo3N0NtanNNdEI2aHlpOHpOY0Z5MFl5dWpFbEVzY2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir News Service&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNelNkeTVRamFpVzFBU2dwcFpxWVBlRk9WSVFKOWREQ0ZQQ1BGS01yOGctMDZvckdpTVdadzViWm8xTlR3aFpDRkpSNV9JYW9tdkU3bHNtNGVjamh5c2FpMkZFTFIxck9zRV9nUmVWTlpIbnVWbTRJSlZRVXlLMlNGXy1ITTNCZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Northeast Live&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPU1hTSHR4bjhkVTg3WnM3VjQ0ZTFiajRIWjQ5